## Verification Plan

### Automated Tests
* Run `pnpm type-check` to verify Sentry types.
* Run `pnpm test run` to ensure no regressions in route or unit tests.
* Execute a simulated error test endpoint (`/api/test-sentry` or locally) to verify error boundaries throw and get captured cleanly.

### Manual Verification
* Build the application (`pnpm build`) to verify that Sentry source maps upload hook registers and next.js compiler wraps correctly.
